      "side": 1,
      "message": "This compares only the applied BootMode from `/Bios`; a committed but unapplied value is invisible. If a previous move left a pending BootMode and the desired mode now matches the applied one, this early return leaves that pending value to land on the next reset, after boot order selection used the old mode. Narrow, since `change_boot` clears the job queue when the boot order differs, but the default boot order path has no clear. Suggest comparing the pending value too, or clearing/confirming it before returning here.",
      "revId": "4b083d88261bbc087ae2aed9e219d8eb85eea997",
      "serverId": "d5d70762-12d0-45a1-890d-524b12d3f735"
    },
    {
